      en: ["The total length of the river is 68 kilometers.", "Empties into the Romsdalsfjord at Åndalsnes.", "Famous for the impressive Slettafossen waterfall.", "Flows past the base of the Trollveggen vertical wall.", "The Kylling Bridge crosses the river at a height of 59 meters.", "Historically significant watercourse for Atlantic salmon."],
